SUMMARY:VA Home Loan Webinar
DESCRIPTION:A plain-English walkthrough of the VA home loan benefit: what y
 ou have earned\, what it actually costs\, and how to use it without gettin
 g talked into something that does not fit. Bring your questions. We answer
