 ally means for your payment\n- The VA funding fee\, who is exempt\, and ho
 w exemptions get applied\n- VA versus conventional and FHA: an honest comp
 arison\, not a sales pitch\n- Using your benefit more than once\, and what
  happens to entitlement when you keep a home\n- BAH\, PCS timing\, and buy
 ing before or after you report to a new duty station\n- Credit\, debt-to-i
 ncome\, and residual income: what underwriters are actually looking at\n\n
 Hosted by Zack Tarbet\, Loan Officer\, OriginPoint.\nDetails and Zoom link
 : https://tarbetmortgageteam.com/webinars/va-home-loan-webinar/
